                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c911ffc-47ef-3b1c-aa3b-3ca6f7b86dd0",
                                        "entry_id": "c3f03954-4c55-3445-ae2b-2094453d11f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a color."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77825f3d-7970-40f4-b4a2-45bdaf5cc32d",
                                                "sense_id": "2c911ffc-47ef-3b1c-aa3b-3ca6f7b86dd0",
                                                "text": "Wash colored items separately from whites and darks to prevent the colors from bleeding."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1cbcdc81-9019-345c-ba11-ca0a8339ff8a",
                                        "entry_id": "c3f03954-4c55-3445-ae2b-2094453d11f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a particular color or kind of color."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1dba86b-6412-4fdb-8153-508337f3c124",
                                                "sense_id": "1cbcdc81-9019-345c-ba11-ca0a8339ff8a",
                                                "text": "The room was red, with a dark-colored rug."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ca1ec40-c3b4-46b3-a8e5-c4b9576c6190",
                                                "sense_id": "1cbcdc81-9019-345c-ba11-ca0a8339ff8a",
                                                "text": "Nara and its deer are so closely associated that the light-brown colored animals are pictured in the city’s tourism ads, on buses, train tickets and more."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dca8aa14-f5c8-380e-bc51-18c0c6bac33e",
                                        "entry_id": "c3f03954-4c55-3445-ae2b-2094453d11f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having prominent colors; colorful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc05337b-a9fe-4a75-a269-9b21d5f71717",
                                                "sense_id": "dca8aa14-f5c8-380e-bc51-18c0c6bac33e",
                                                "text": "The singer wore a colored shirt."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fadd2edf-c515-3479-bfac-07c2472fddd9",
                                        "entry_id": "c3f03954-4c55-3445-ae2b-2094453d11f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Biased; pervasively (but potentially subtly) influenced in a particular way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8ad6bca-c028-4299-b0ba-6f5bb304e1f4",
                                                "sense_id": "fadd2edf-c515-3479-bfac-07c2472fddd9",
                                                "text": "Mr. Brewer gave me his version of the history of the Conference of Studio Unions. It appeared to me then and appears to me now to have been a very colored view."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78408f5f-8135-4ec5-a04c-4f609181c0c5",
                                                "sense_id": "fadd2edf-c515-3479-bfac-07c2472fddd9",
                                                "text": "But by and large, a majority of Sanduskians never read any newspaper other than the local journal and I am convinced that they get a far more colored view of national news than they did when the city had competing dailies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7067be4-5b67-4899-8d2b-df4db5bb982a",
                                                "sense_id": "fadd2edf-c515-3479-bfac-07c2472fddd9",
                                                "text": "The organization's traditions and culture are inwardly focused. It is not conceivable that an alternative solution could exist. This results in a very colored view of the marketplace."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "061516f1-3a2c-3123-b1a5-38a149206c57",
                                        "entry_id": "c3f03954-4c55-3445-ae2b-2094453d11f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of skin color other than white; in particular, black."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "dated",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2acf0ffb-63c7-4aa4-ae0f-e2e2d69d4fdf",
                                                "sense_id": "061516f1-3a2c-3123-b1a5-38a149206c57",
                                                "text": "[…] a beautiful silk standard donated to the Third Battalion by the colored ladies of the city of New York, was formally presented to the battalion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df3584f1-256d-4c00-a0c6-b4c2bdd849a0",
                                                "sense_id": "061516f1-3a2c-3123-b1a5-38a149206c57",
                                                "text": "He made a smart remark about colored people and I got mad. I got mad because I like colored people. In fact, a colored lady raised me. Some of my best friends are colored people."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27f4d160-675d-42b4-8ed3-7b20884c9e8d",
                                                "sense_id": "061516f1-3a2c-3123-b1a5-38a149206c57",
                                                "text": "To find a job is like a haystack needle / Because where he lives they don't use colored people"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "790b237c-23c0-3304-9bf8-a8615d887036",
                                        "entry_id": "c3f03954-4c55-3445-ae2b-2094453d11f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Belonging to a multiracial ethnic group or category, having ancestry from more than one of the racial groups of Southern Africa (black, white, and Asian). (Under apartheid, used as a metadescription for mixed-race people and peoples such as the Cape Coloureds.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Botswana",
                                            "Namibia",
                                            "South-Africa",
                                            "US",
                                            "Zimbabwe",
                                            "capitalized",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a54bb1d4-02aa-4f6f-9595-4188113758c0",
                                                "sense_id": "790b237c-23c0-3304-9bf8-a8615d887036",
                                                "text": "Most of the colored community speaks Afrikaans, whereas languages like Xhosa or Venda are typically spoken by blacks and English is spoken mostly by whites."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f938ff9e-53e3-4dc5-83a6-bd42ae7721e3",
                                                "sense_id": "790b237c-23c0-3304-9bf8-a8615d887036",
                                                "text": "By the end of the 19th century District Six had become a bustling and heavily populated working class neighborhood whose population was predominantly coloured, Cape Malay and African intermixed with Indian, Chinese, and European migrants."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0e2ea2d-a99d-4074-b739-0b39810271b7",
                                                "sense_id": "790b237c-23c0-3304-9bf8-a8615d887036",
                                                "text": "By 1929, many of the Coloured radicals who had been excluded from the ICU had found a temporary home in the Western Cape branch of the African National Congress (ANC)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7115bbfe-782c-37be-86d6-a77525f20247",
                                        "entry_id": "c3f03954-4c55-3445-ae2b-2094453d11f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Designated for use by colored people (in either the US or South African sense)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c0b1ea2-1b72-4656-8441-e5a65e393ca9",
                                                "sense_id": "7115bbfe-782c-37be-86d6-a77525f20247",
                                                "text": "a colored drinking fountain"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6878cb5a-eae9-4000-b9a5-e0188a7402c0",
                                                "sense_id": "7115bbfe-782c-37be-86d6-a77525f20247",
                                                "text": "a colored hospital"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb1a0b92-84d9-4187-ab81-2f9d709a4792",
                                                "sense_id": "7115bbfe-782c-37be-86d6-a77525f20247",
                                                "text": "New Orleans is a very dull town. It’s against the law to go to the colored section. The bars are insufferably dreary."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
